{"data":{"body":"[P1] Recheck the shared fatal immediately before entering user code. Another hook can record a fatal after this worker's entry check but while `onUserFunctionStart` is running. If that hook returns, this still executes the step/condition/child body\u2014even after bounded finalization\u2014allowing external side effects that may repeat on retry. Add the fatal check inside this `try`, immediately before `userFunction.get()`, plus a regression with a start hook released after a peer fatal is recorded.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76jWlw","finding_digest":"1450ea386dc760ce257766716e782411b224cca8cf1ea36bc5a188d892c0e5b4","finding_id":"arf_v1_criouodny5qm4jlxmzyw46becg","finding_key":"sdk/operation/base-durable-operation::run-user-function::peer-fatal-before-body","identity_key":"sdk/operation/base-durable-operation::run-user-function::peer-fatal-before-body","line":403,"observation_digest":"d2f87724e39290da55dc88cd1fc08e9ef454591c0824747fbb2e7b4b07751cfa","observation_id":"aro_v1_2l4hojhdskinuvo4rdgr7qeot3","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/BaseDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T05:56:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rqwbz3xu3pzf5jpbjbwqa7a7fx","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"58e3740634189a90aa161e2e96ed5436aefe9fcc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":403,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_tu436jyqchyfz2jihhzycjur4l"},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_cj25htra76isvrvotjjvxqxz43","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T05:56:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
